summaries at $\lambda=0$. The levels remain small under the normalisation of
Section~\ref{sec:model}. The synthetic family
comprises 12 networks and cannot support population claims; we treat it as a set of structural stress tests and the benchmark
collection as the empirical anchor. The figure of $0.167$ is two networks
